{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42062","headline":"暮春吟怀寄姚端先辈 · 李中","name":"暮春吟怀寄姚端先辈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无奈诗魔旦夕生，更堪芳草满长汀。\n故人还爽花前约，新月又生江上亭。\n庄梦断时灯欲烬，蜀魂啼处酒初醒。\n何时得见登龙客，隔却千山万仞青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}